{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00354",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 4.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.44,
      "end_seconds": 9.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.34,
      "end_seconds": 18.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "I wanted to get tiredness all the time looked at. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "How long has this been going on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.35,
      "end_seconds": 28.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.91,
      "text": "Ever since... since last night, really. I took the morning off to come in today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.7,
      "end_seconds": 31.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Have you been feeling cold?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.68,
      "end_seconds": 34.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yes, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.89,
      "end_seconds": 39.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Have you had tiredness all the time before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.39,
      "end_seconds": 46.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Yes, something like this happened last winter, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.21,
      "end_seconds": 49.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.37,
      "end_seconds": 51.24,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.24,
      "end_seconds": 72.11,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Have you had any low mood, shortness of breath, night sweats or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.85,
      "end_seconds": 80.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.2,
      "text": "Hmm, no low mood, shortness of breath, night sweats or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.47,
      "end_seconds": 83.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Have you had any blood in the stool?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.08,
      "end_seconds": 91.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Um, no, I haven't had any blood in the stool."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.81,
      "end_seconds": 95.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.82,
      "end_seconds": 101.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Yes, uh, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.74,
      "end_seconds": 104.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.59,
      "end_seconds": 108.48,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.99,
      "end_seconds": 124.31,
      "duration_seconds": 14.32,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.27,
      "end_seconds": 127.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.78,
      "end_seconds": 135.22,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.75,
      "end_seconds": 141.99,
      "duration_seconds": 6.24,
      "text": "I've had diabetes for about ten years now. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.32,
      "end_seconds": 146.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.66,
      "end_seconds": 160.27,
      "duration_seconds": 13.61,
      "text": "Yes, um, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.08,
      "end_seconds": 164.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.46,
      "end_seconds": 172.61,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "I take metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.33,
      "end_seconds": 188.07,
      "duration_seconds": 14.74,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.56,
      "end_seconds": 190.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Well, that's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.03,
      "end_seconds": 194.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.42,
      "end_seconds": 197.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "I had a hysterectomy about twelve years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.83,
      "end_seconds": 202.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.25,
      "end_seconds": 207.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.61,
      "end_seconds": 223.36,
      "duration_seconds": 14.75,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.96,
      "end_seconds": 226.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.95,
      "end_seconds": 231.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.23,
      "end_seconds": 232.93,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.09,
      "end_seconds": 235.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Let me press here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.23,
      "end_seconds": 246.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "You look a little pale in the eyelids."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.86,
      "end_seconds": 248.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Yes, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.22,
      "end_seconds": 252.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.48,
      "end_seconds": 267.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Your thyroid isn't enlarged, I can't feel any lumps in your neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.1,
      "end_seconds": 281.55,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "Okay, all done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.11,
      "end_seconds": 284.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Let me double-check something in your record."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.48,
      "end_seconds": 287.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Of course, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.38,
      "end_seconds": 323.85,
      "duration_seconds": 24.47,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with persistent tiredness, possibly from low iron at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. I can't rule out vitamin deficiency yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had tiredness all the time, since last night, and no blood in the stool or chest pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.32,
      "end_seconds": 326.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.84,
      "end_seconds": 331.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.97,
      "end_seconds": 346.41,
      "duration_seconds": 14.44,
      "text": "Um, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.74,
      "end_seconds": 354.19,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for fatigue. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.46,
      "end_seconds": 356.3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.5,
      "end_seconds": 383.2,
      "duration_seconds": 25.7,
      "text": "I'll start you on vitamin D, 60000 units, once a week, for eight weeks. That should help with low energy. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. Try to keep a regular sleep time and get some daylight in the morning. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach. Please don't sit on it if the symptoms get worse. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.71,
      "end_seconds": 384.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.5,
      "end_seconds": 394.06,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again after the results are back. Just to confirm, what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 394.69,
      "end_seconds": 399.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 399.92,
      "end_seconds": 404.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 406.0,
      "end_seconds": 409.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Oh, no, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 411.51,
      "end_seconds": 412.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}